# Authenticated venue

Use `useAuthenticatedVenue()` (or `getVenueFor(venueObj, auth)`) for API calls.
Both return a **single cached `Venue` per (venue, auth)** and validate with a
background `status()`.

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — discards SDK cache and skips connection validation
const venue = new Venue({ url, auth });

// ✅ GOOD
const venue = useAuthenticatedVenue();
```

Auth state lives in localStorage under `"venue-auth"` via `hooks/use-auth.ts`.
Bridge to SDK auth with `lib/auth-provider.ts`.
